msgstr "Z-axis homing isu, mungkin memiliki gangguan eksternal"

msgid "[Printing] XY Motor: XY motor speed limit exceeded. The motor will be released. Please reduce the print speed or re-slice and print again.Z Motor: Z motor speed limit exceeded. The motor will be released. Please reduce the print speed or re-slice and print again.E Motor: Extruder speed limit exceeded. The motor will be released. Please reduce the print speed or re-slice and print again.[Not Printing] XY Motor: XY motor speed limit exceeded. The motor will be released. Please reduce the XY motor movement speed.Z Motor: Z motor speed limit exceeded. The motor will be released. Please reduce the Z motor movement speed.E Motor: Extruder speed limit exceeded. The motor will be released. Please reduce the extruder movement speed."
msgstr "[Mencetak] Motor XY: Batas kecepatan motor XY terlampaui. Motornya akan dilepas. Silakan kurangi kecepatan cetak atau potong ulang dan cetak lagi. Z Motor: Batas kecepatan motor Z terlampaui. Motornya akan dilepas. Silakan kurangi kecepatan cetak atau potong ulang dan cetak lagi. E Motor: Batas kecepatan ekstruder terlampaui. Motornya akan dilepas. Harap kurangi kecepatan cetak atau potong ulang dan cetak lagi. [Tidak Mencetak] Motor XY: Batas kecepatan motor XY terlampaui. Motornya akan dilepas. Harap kurangi kecepatan gerak motor XY. Motor Z: Batas kecepatan motor Z terlampaui. Motornya akan dilepas. Harap kurangi kecepatan gerakan motor Z. Motor E: Batas kecepatan ekstruder terlampaui. Motornya akan dilepas. Harap kurangi kecepatan gerakan ekstruder."

msgid "[X/Y/E/Z1/Z2] step-servo position issue, please try again after resolving"
msgstr "Masalah posisi step-servo [X/Y/E/Z1/Z2], silakan coba lagi setelah diperbaiki"

msgid "[Printing] XY Motor: An obstacle was detected during the extruder's movement. This print has been canceled and the motor is released.Z Motor: An obstacle was detected during the heated bed's movement. This print has been canceled and the motor is released.E Motor: An extrusion anomaly was detected, possibly a clog, tangle, or jam. Printing has been paused.[Not Printing] XY Motorstep-servo: An obstacle was detected during the nozzle's movement. The motor will be released.Z Motor: An obstacle was detected during the heated bed's movement. The motor will be released.E Motor: An extrusion anomaly was detected, possibly a clog, tangle, or jam. The motor will be released."
msgstr "[Pencetakan] Motor XY: Hambatan terdeteksi selama pergerakan ekstruder. Pencetakan ini telah dibatalkan dan motor dilepaskan. Z Motor: Sebuah hambatan terdeteksi selama pergerakan tempat tidur yang dipanaskan. Pencetakan ini telah dibatalkan dan motor dilepaskan. E Motor: Anomali ekstrusi terdeteksi, kemungkinan tersumbat, kusut, atau macet. Pencetakan telah dihentikan sementara. [Tidak Mencetak] XY Motorstep-servo: Ada hambatan yang terdeteksi selama pergerakan nosel. Motor akan dilepaskan.Z Motor: Sebuah hambatan terdeteksi selama pergerakan tempat tidur yang dipanaskan. Motor akan dilepas. Motor E: Anomali ekstrusi terdeteksi, kemungkinan tersumbat, kusut, atau macet. Motornya akan dilepas."

msgid "X Motor: X motor identification error detected. The motor wire may be connected improperly or the motor may be damaged.Y Motor: Y motor identification error detected. The motor wire may be connected improperly or the motor may be damaged.Z1 Motor: Z1 motor identification error detected. The motor wire may be connected improperly or the motor may be damaged.Z2 Motor: Z2 motor identification error detected. The motor wire may be connected improperly or the motor may be damaged.E Motor: Extruder motor identification error detected. The motor wire may be connected improperly or the motor may be damaged."
msgstr "X Motor: X kesalahan identifikasi motor terdeteksi. Kabel motor mungkin tidak tersambung dengan benar atau motor mungkin rusak. Y Motor: Kesalahan identifikasi motor Y terdeteksi. Kabel motor mungkin tidak tersambung dengan benar atau motor mungkin rusak. Motor Z1: Kesalahan identifikasi motor Z1 terdeteksi. Kabel motor mungkin tidak tersambung dengan benar atau motor mungkin rusak. Motor Z2: Kesalahan identifikasi motor Z2 terdeteksi. Kabel motor mungkin tidak tersambung dengan benar atau motor mungkin rusak. E Motor: Kesalahan identifikasi motor ekstruder terdeteksi. Kabel motor mungkin tidak tersambung dengan benar atau motor mungkin rusak."


msgid "communication issue, please try again after resolving."
msgstr "Komunikasi isu, silakan coba lagi setelah pemecahan."

msgid "Retract issue, check for filament or spool jams. Click &quot;Retry&quot; after resolving."
msgstr "Masalah menarik kembali, periksa filamen atau kemacetan spool. Klik & quot; Coba & quot; setelah memilah."

msgid "Feed issue, check for filament or spool jams. Click &quot;Retry&quot; after resolving."
msgstr "Masalah makan, periksa filamen atau jams spool. Klik & quot; Coba & quot; setelah memilah."

msgid "System error."
msgstr "Sistem error."

msgid "Feed issue , filament may be stuck from loader to CFS hub. Please resolve the issue and click the &quot;Retry&quot; button."
msgstr "Masalah pengumpanan, filamen mungkin tersangkut dari loader ke hub CFS. Perbaiki masalah lalu klik tombol &quot;Coba lagi&quot;."

msgid "Feed issue , filament may be blocked between the CFS hub and extruder filament detector. Please resolve the issue and click &quot;Retry&quot; button."
msgstr "Masalah pengumpanan, filamen mungkin tersumbat antara hub CFS dan detektor filamen ekstruder. Perbaiki masalah lalu klik tombol &quot;Coba lagi&quot;."

msgid "Feed issue , filament may be jammed between the extruder sensor and the extruder gear. Please resolve the issue and click the &quot;Retry&quot; button."
msgstr "Masalah pengumpanan, filamen mungkin macet antara sensor ekstruder dan roda gigi ekstruder. Perbaiki masalah lalu klik tombol &quot;Coba lagi&quot;."

msgid "Feed issue , filament may be stuck between the CFS hub sensor and the gear. Please resolve the issue and click the &quot;Retry&quot; button."
msgstr "Masalah pengumpanan, filamen mungkin tersangkut antara sensor hub CFS dan roda gigi. Perbaiki masalah lalu klik tombol &quot;Coba lagi&quot;."

msgid "filament runs out, please refill."
msgstr "filamen habis, silakan isi ulang."

msgid "Command failed, current scenario does not support this command."
msgstr "Perintah gagal, skenario saat ini tidak mendukung perintah ini."

msgid "Cutter issue, cutter might be jammed, please try again after resolving"
msgstr "Masalah Cutter, cutter mungkin macet, silakan coba lagi setelah pemecahan"

msgid "RFID cannot be read, please manually edit filament"
msgstr "RFID tidak dapat dibaca, harap edit filamen secara manual"

msgid "PTFE tube may have detached from the pneumatic fitting, Printing paused, please try again after resolving"
msgstr "Tabung PTFE mungkin terlepas dari fitting pneumatik. Pencetakan dijeda, silakan coba lagi setelah diperbaiki"

msgid "Extruder may be clogged. Click &quot;Retry&quot; after resolving."
msgstr "Extruder mungkin tersumbat. Klik & quot; Coba & quot; setelah memilah."

msgid "The filament buffer signal is abnormal,the buffer may be stuck or the filament may be tangle."
msgstr "Sinyal buffer filamen tidak normal, buffer mungkin macet atau filamen mungkin kusut."

msgid "Filament may tangled, please try again after resolving"
msgstr "Filamen mungkin kusut, silakan coba lagi setelah pemecahan"

msgid "filament may be broken in CFS."
msgstr "Filamen mungkin putus di dalam CFS."

msgid "Retract issue, filament cannot be returned to CFS hub. Please resolve the issue and click the &quot;Retry&quot; button."
msgstr "Masalah retraksi, filamen tidak dapat dikembalikan ke hub CFS. Perbaiki masalah lalu klik tombol &quot;Coba lagi&quot;."

msgid "Retract issue, filaments may be inserted into the CFS hub. Remove and click the &quot;Retry&quot; button."
msgstr "Masalah retraksi, filamen mungkin masuk ke hub CFS. Keluarkan lalu klik tombol &quot;Coba lagi&quot;."

msgid "Retract issue, Filament Buffer failure. Please resolve and click &quot;Retry&quot; button."
msgstr "Tarik kembali isu, Filamen Buffer gagal. Silakan pecahkan dan klik & quot; Coba & quot; tombol."

msgid "TR2852: Filament detector triggered abnormally, possibly due to an external material rack being used with CFS."
msgstr "TR2852: Detektor filamen terpicu secara tidak normal, kemungkinan karena rak material eksternal digunakan dengan CFS."

msgid "CFS temperature and humidity sensor abnormal."
msgstr "Sensor suhu dan kelembapan CFS tidak normal."

msgid "TC2854: Filament detected in the extruder, affecting the cutter calibration. Please remove the filament and try again."
msgstr "TC2854: Filamen terdeteksi di ekstruder dan memengaruhi kalibrasi pemotong. Keluarkan filamen lalu coba lagi."

msgid "TC2855: Cutter calibrat failed. Please try again after resolving."
msgstr "TC2855: Cutter kalibrasi gagal. Silakan coba lagi setelah pemecahan."

msgid "TC2856: Cutter issue, the cutter may be jammed or missing. Click &quot;Retry&quot; after resolving."
msgstr "TC2856: Masalah pemotong, pemotong mungkin macet atau hilang. Klik &quot;Coba lagi&quot; setelah diperbaiki."

msgid "CFS feeding motor overload, maybe excessive load or unload resistance or the filament tangled or stuck."
msgstr "Motor pengumpan CFS kelebihan beban; mungkin hambatan saat memuat/melepas terlalu besar, atau filamen kusut/tersangkut."

msgid "FS2858: CFS EEPROM abnormal."
msgstr "FS2858: EEPROM CFS tidak normal."

msgid "FO2859: CFS filament odometry abnormal."
msgstr "FO2859: Odometri filamen CFS tidak normal."

msgid "FB2860: CFS filament buffer abnormal."
msgstr "FB2860: Buffer filamen CFS tidak normal."

msgid "FS2861: CFS left RFID board abnormal."
msgstr "FS2861: Papan RFID kiri CFS tidak normal."

msgid "FS2862: CFS right RFID board abnormal."
msgstr "FS2862: Papan RFID kanan CFS tidak normal."

msgid "The file where the last unexpected stop was detected"
msgstr "Berkas tempat berhenti tak terduga terakhir terdeteksi"

msgid "No filaments detected, do you want to continue printing?"
msgstr "Tidak ada filamen terdeteksi, apakah Anda ingin melanjutkan pencetakan?"

msgid "There is no filaments in the current rack"
msgstr "Tidak ada filamen di rak saat ini"

msgid "No matching automatic refill filaments"
msgstr "Tidak ada filamen otomatis yang cocok"

msgid "Axis movement exceeded limit"
msgstr "Pergerakan Axis melampaui batas"

msgid "Default"
msgstr "Baku"

msgid "Using Creality Filament System (CFS) for easy filament management, including automatic refilling, multi-color printing, and support printing."
msgstr "Gunakan Creality Filament System (CFS) untuk manajemen filamen yang mudah, termasuk pengisian otomatis, pencetakan multiwarna, dan pencetakan support."

msgid "Creality Cloud devices currently do not support displaying preview PNG"
msgstr "Perangkat Creality Cloud saat ini belum mendukung tampilan pratinjau PNG"

msgid "Invalid hostname"
msgstr "Nama host tak valid"

msgid "Printing preparation in progress..."
msgstr "Mencetak persiapan dalam proses..."

msgid "Filament Weight"
msgstr "Filamen Weight"

msgid "Feed issue, filament failed to exit extruder.Please resolve and click 'Retry' button."
msgstr "Masalah makan, filamen gagal keluar dari extruder. Silakan pecahkan dan klik tombol 'Coba'."

msgid "The current printer's material rack consumables do not exist. Do you want to continue printing?"
msgstr "Material pada rak material printer saat ini tidak tersedia. Apakah Anda ingin melanjutkan pencetakan?"

msgid "Hotbed failed to return to the maximum Z-axis position or tilt calibration at this position failed,please try again after resolving."
msgstr "Hotbed gagal kembali ke posisi maksimum sumbu Z atau kalibrasi kemiringan di posisi ini gagal. Silakan coba lagi setelah diperbaiki."

msgid "Abnormal resistance in the Y-axis movement direction,  motor released. Fix issue and restart."
msgstr "Resistansi tidak normal pada arah gerak sumbu Y, motor dilepas. Perbaiki masalah lalu mulai ulang."

msgid "Abnormal resistance under the hotbed, motor released. Fix issue and restart."
msgstr "Perlawanan abnormal di bawah hotbed, motor dilepaskan. Perbaiki isu dan restart."

msgid "Extruder extrusion anomaly, possible clog or blockage. motor released."
msgstr "Anomali ekstruder, kemungkinan clog atau penyumbatan. Motor dilepaskan."

msgid "Extruder speed limit exceeded. The motor will be released. Please reduce the extruder movement speed."
msgstr "Batas kecepatan ekstruder terlampaui. Motor akan dilepas. Harap kurangi kecepatan gerak ekstruder."

msgid "Y motor identification error detected. The motor wire may be connected improperly or the motor may be damaged."
msgstr "Terdeteksi kesalahan identifikasi motor Y. Kabel motor mungkin tidak tersambung dengan benar atau motor mungkin rusak."

msgid "Z1 motor identification error detected. The motor wire may be connected improperly or the motor may be damaged."
msgstr "Terdeteksi kesalahan identifikasi motor Z1. Kabel motor mungkin tidak tersambung dengan benar atau motor mungkin rusak."

msgid "Z2 motor identification error detected. The motor wire may be connected improperly or the motor may be damaged."
msgstr "Terdeteksi kesalahan identifikasi motor Z2. Kabel motor mungkin tidak tersambung dengan benar atau motor mungkin rusak."

msgid "E motor identification error detected. The motor wire may be connected improperly or the motor may be damaged."
msgstr "Terdeteksi kesalahan identifikasi motor E. Kabel motor mungkin tidak tersambung dengan benar atau motor mungkin rusak."

msgid "[x or y or e] axis servo motor hardware abnormality/[z1 or z2] axis servo motor hardware abnormality, the platform plate will drop"
msgstr "Perangkat keras motor servo sumbu [x atau y atau e] tidak normal/perangkat keras motor servo sumbu [z1 atau z2] tidak normal, platform akan turun"

msgid "X/Y/Z/E axis step-servo motor initialization error, motor communication line may be connected incorrectly"
msgstr "Kesalahan inisialisasi motor step-servo sumbu X/Y/Z/E, kabel komunikasi motor mungkin tersambung tidak benar"

msgid "Chamber heater fan abnormal, chamber heating closed."
msgstr "Fans pemanas kamar tidak normal, ruang pemanas ditutup."

msgid "Belt tension module error, left side belt communication line may be connected improperly. "
msgstr "Kesalahan modul tegangan belt, jalur komunikasi belt sisi kiri mungkin tidak tersambung dengan benar."

msgid "Belt tension module error, right side belt tension module not calibrated, please recalibrate the module."
msgstr "Kesalahan modul tegangan belt, modul tegangan belt sisi kanan belum dikalibrasi, harap kalibrasi ulang modul."

msgid "Belt tension module error, left side belt tension module not calibrated, please recalibrate the module. "
msgstr "Kesalahan modul tegangan belt, modul tegangan belt sisi kiri belum dikalibrasi. Harap kalibrasi ulang modul."

msgid "Belt tension module error, please troubleshoot and try recalibrating. "
msgstr "Kesalahan modul tegangan belt, harap lakukan pemecahan masalah dan coba kalibrasi ulang."

msgid "Belt tension timeout failure, please try retightening or restarting. "
msgstr "Batas waktu ketegangan belt gagal, silakan coba untuk pensiun atau memulai kembali."

msgid "Abnormal belt tensioning module, right belt tensioning module calibration value abnormal, please recalibrate the module."
msgstr "Modul tegangan belt tidak normal, nilai kalibrasi modul tegangan belt kanan tidak normal, harap kalibrasi ulang modul."

msgid "Abnormal belt tensioning module, left belt tensioning module calibration value abnormal, please recalibrate the module."
msgstr "Modul tegangan belt tidak normal, nilai kalibrasi modul tegangan belt kiri tidak normal, harap kalibrasi ulang modul."

msgid "Hotbed failed to reach the maximum position. Check for sensor issues or bed tilt.Please check and retry."
msgstr "Hotbed gagal mencapai posisi maksimum. Periksa masalah sensor atau kemiringan bed. Silakan periksa lalu coba lagi."

msgid "Abnormal heat break fan"
msgstr "Fans istirahat panas tidak normal"

msgid "MCU task scheduling failed, possibly due to high load or communication issues."
msgstr "MCU penjadwalan tugas gagal, mungkin karena beban tinggi atau masalah komunikasi."

msgid "Extruder MCU temperature is too high, possibly due to high chamber temperature or delayed cooling of the extruder motherboard."
msgstr "Suhu MCU ekstruder terlalu tinggi, kemungkinan karena suhu chamber tinggi atau pendinginan motherboard ekstruder terlambat."

msgid "Cutter not detected."
msgstr "Cutter tidak terdeteksi."

msgid "Feed issue, filament buffer failure. Please resolve and click \"Retry\" button."
msgstr "Masalah makan, kegagalan penyangga filamen. Silakan pecahkan dan klik tombol \"Coba\"."

msgid "Detected printing plate is missing, printing paused"
msgstr "Pelat pencetakan hilang, pencetakan berhenti"

msgid "Detected printing plate is missing and foreign object on the printing plate, printing paused"
msgstr "Terdeteksi pelat cetak hilang dan ada objek asing pada pelat cetak; pencetakan dijeda."

msgid "Flow ratio calibration image anomaly, printing with default values."
msgstr "Flow rasio kalibrasi gambar anomali, pencetakan dengan nilai baku."

msgid "Flow ratio calibration failed, printing with default values."
msgstr "Lipat kalibrasi rasio gagal, pencetakan dengan nilai baku."

msgid "Detected waste chute is block. "
msgstr "Terdeteksi chute limbah tersumbat."

msgid "Nozzle  camera failed to start, try restarting."
msgstr "Kamera nozzle gagal dijalankan, coba mulai lagi."

msgid "The five-way connection is occupied, please return the material first! "
msgstr "Lima jalan koneksi ditempati, silakan kembali material pertama!"

msgid "The extruder is occupied and pre-loading cannot be performed."
msgstr "Extruder diduduki dan pra-loading tidak dapat dilakukan."

